        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God standeth in the congregation of the mighty; he judgeth among the gods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How long will ye judge unjustly, and accept the persons of the wicked? Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Defend the poor and fatherless: do justice to the afflicted and needy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deliver the poor and needy: rid",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "them",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.82.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.82.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "out of the hand of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They know not, neither will they understand; they walk on in darkness: all the foundations of the earth are out of course.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have said, Ye",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.82.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.82.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gods; and all of you",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.82.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.82.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "children of the most High.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But ye shall die like men, and fall like one of the princes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 82:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arise, O God, judge the earth: for thou shalt inherit all nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.82.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.82.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
